  09_ s7            correct
  11_ s5            correct
  12_ s5 (step 2)   correct
  12_ s6 (step 3)   LOST      -- twin reported ON with the process dead
  13_ T1 s5         correct
  13_ T1 s6         LOST      -- transition CAUGHT: is_up 1 -> 0 at t=1788369874.19,
                                 back to 1 at t=1788369877.27 (3.08 s later), process dead
                                 throughout. So setVertexDown DID land and was then overwritten.
  13_ T2 s5         NO-OP with Success -- see below
  13_ T2 s6         correct
